# npm packaging ignore file.
#
# This file takes precedence over the crate-level .gitignore for publish
# purposes: the wasm-pack outputs (pkg/, pkg-node/) MUST be included in the
# published tarball (they are whitelisted in package.json "files"), so they
# are deliberately NOT excluded here. Only local scratch/artifacts that the
# "files" whitelist already omits are listed.
*.tgz
node_modules/
target/
